tyle","learning style"],["parent note","parent note"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short biography","blocks":[{"type":"bio","name":"Teacher Lena Park","paras":["Lena says, “If students **feel** safe, they **learn** faster.” When she **explains** a rule, she **uses** pictures. If a child **struggles**, she **sits** with them.","She **gets on** well with parents: when they **ask**, she **answers** at once."],"years":"Born 1984","facts":[["Job","teacher"],["Rule","safe students learn faster"],["Tool","pictures"],["Habit","answers parents at once"]],"gloss":[["struggle","ter dificuldade"],["safe","seguro"],["parent","responsável"],["at once","imediatamente"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Safe students learn faster.","ans":"T","why":"learn faster."},{"q":"Lena avoids pictures.","ans":"F","why":"uses pictures."},{"q":"Lena answers parents quickly.","ans":"T","why":"at once."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“struggle” = ?","opts":["ter dificuldade","lutar só","estudar"],"ans":0,"why":"struggle."},{"q":"“at once” = ?","opts":["imediatamente","uma vez","junto"],"ans":0,"why":"at once."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Zero Conditional: production","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Para…","Exemplo"],"rows":[["regra de sala","**If students feel safe, they learn faster.**"],["hábito profissional","**When a child struggles, she sits with them.**"],["relação","**When parents ask, she answers.**"]],"cap":"Zero Conditional: production"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**get on (well) with** = dar-se bem com: *She gets on well with parents.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"If students feel safe, they ___ faster. (learn)","a":"learn","why":"presente."},{"s":"When a child struggles, she ___ with them. (sit)","a":"sits","why":"3ª pessoa."},{"s":"She ___ on wel